--[[
 CrystalDK Version Beta-2.1.1

 Roadmap:

 New Cards: 
  LineGraph - A line graph - complex
  Table - A table, to present data...
  SliderSelection - Like Image or Knob, but upward facing sliders.
  Banner - Like a divider but an image
  LinkParagraph - Paragraph which supports links
  Color - A filled Progressbar with no text only filled with an adjustable color (i.e. for heatmaps)
  PathInput - Will be an input for a path (i.e. game.Workspace.Trees.Model.Script)
 
 New Card Rules:
  CopyValue - Copies the output value, or input text, or helpful information on commands.
  BringTo - Changes the GUI and focuses on a different card (I.e. from Main tab to Dev tab and scrolls down.)
  RandomizeValue - Adjustable, will change values inputted (into sliders or steppers) with an adjustable limit
  RequireRegion - Will require the player to be within a XYZ region to work
  RequireCardVisible - Will be hidden untill other card is enabled (i.e. Aimbot & Aimbot Values)
  HiddenCard - Will be invisible untill a condition is met (i.e. 500 coins on a game)
  OnClose - Will execute when the GUI is closed
  RequireKey - Will execute only if the player is holding down a specific key 
  Transition - For sliders, Will smoothly go up to the given value instead of snapping.
  RequirePing - Will require a players ping to be below X to execute
  PermissionBlur - Will have the card info blurred untill the # permission is granted
  ClickCounter - Will execute different callbacks based on # of clicks

 New feature:
  CardGrid - Will let you put cards in a 4x4 grid, saving space and being useful for small toggles or buttons.
  Pinned favourites tab - Will be like the QuickSelection but will add a tab at the end called Favourites
  QuickSearch - Ctrl+F will enable a floating search bar which lets you search for any card fast 
  
 CrystalDK Settings:
  BlurIntensity - Default will be default, lets script change blur intensity
  Reorder - When enabled, will let user drag & drop to reorder cards - complex
  PermissionKey - Will automatically grant # permission based on key entered
  SuffixKey - When entered with a suffix, (i.e. DemoKey:simple) then load a different version (i.e. loading a simplified version) - complex

 Optimisations to add:
  When stress testing 1000 cards in 1 tab, heavy lag. Needs optimising
  Multiple toggle loops (100+) cause frame breaks

]]

