--[[
 Complex explained in depth:

 LineGraph:
  Literally just a line graph, complex to code though.

 Reorder:
  Will let the user drag and drop cards to reorder.

 SuffixKey:
  Entering a suffix after : after the key will let the user select different "profiles"
  
  Example:

  Entering Daw1dk loads normally
  Entering Daw1dk:simple loads a simplified version 
  Entering Daw1dk:complex loads a complex version 
  Entering Daw1dk:test loads a in test version 

  This will be scripted backend, with in settings there being a selectable list of enabled, with default being an option.

  Upcoming suffixes;
   
   :simple - Will load with rate limits, less detail
   :complex - Will load with less rate limits, more detail, more explorability within cards
   :developer - Will unlimit all adjustable features
   :tab:overview - Will load with an extra tab, where an overview of crystalDK is shown
   :tab:developer - Will load with an extra tab, where adjustables are shown (i.e. a toggle to unlock sliders, or a kill switch)

  - more to come soon
   
]]
